<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND V STEAUA BUCHAREST TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND V STEAUA BUCHAREST TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's</p>
<p>European Cup Champions' League, group B match between Borussia</p>
<p>Dortmund of Germany and Romania's Steaua Bucharest:</p>
<p>Borussia - 1-Stefan Klos, 2-Knut Reinhardt, 6-Mathias</p>
<p>Sammer, 8-Michael Zorc, 9-Stephane Chapuisat, 13-Karlheinz</p>
<p>Riedle, 14-Paul Lambert, 15-Juergen Kohler, 16-Martin Kree,</p>
<p>17-Joerg Heinrich, 23-Rene Tgretschok.</p>
<p>Steaua - 23-Bogdan Stelea, 3-Roland Nagy, 4-Tiberiu Csik,</p>
<p>5-Bogden Bucur, 8-Damian Militaru, 9-Augustin Calin, 11-Sabin</p>
<p>Ilie, 15-Marius Baciu, 16-Ilie Miu, 17-Laurentiu Rosu, 22-Denis</p>
<p>Serban.</p>
</text>
